i><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/target-audience\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Target Audience<\/a>:<\/strong>&nbsp;[TARGET AUDIENCE]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Primary Goal:<\/strong>&nbsp;[YOUR GOAL]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Current Challenges:<\/strong>&nbsp;[CHALLENGES]&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What I Need<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Develop a customized Instagram growth strategy that includes the following:&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Viral Growth Strategy<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Explain the latest Instagram algorithm and the key factors that increase reach and engagement.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Share proven tactics to create content with high viral potential.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Implementation Plan<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Provide a clear, step-by-step action plan that I can follow to grow my account consistently.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Include posting frequency, content planning, audience engagement, and optimization tips.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Content Ideas &amp; Examples<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Generate creative post, Reel, and carousel ideas tailored to my niche.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Include attention-grabbing hooks, content outlines, captions, and strong calls to action.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Recommended Tools &amp; Resources<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Suggest the best tools for content creation, video editing, design, analytics, scheduling, hashtag research, and trend discovery.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Common Mistakes to Avoid<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Highlight the most common reasons Instagram content&nbsp;fails to&nbsp;perform and explain how to avoid them.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Performance Metrics<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Identify&nbsp;the most important KPIs to track, including reach, engagement rate, shares, saves, watch time, profile visits, and follower growth.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Explain how to measure and improve each metric.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Growth Timeline &amp; Expected Results<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Provide a realistic growth roadmap with weekly or monthly milestones based on consistent execution.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Include recommendations for testing, analyzing performance, and refining the strategy over time.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Output Requirements<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Tailor every recommendation to my niche, audience, goals, and challenges.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Focus on practical, actionable advice rather than generic tips.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure all strategies align with the latest Instagram best practices.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Prioritize content that encourages shares, saves, comments, watch time, and meaningful engagement.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use clear headings, bullet points, examples, and actionable insights for easy implementation.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Instagram Prompt to Create&nbsp;Scroll-Stopping Reels that go Viral<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>You are an Instagram Reels Strategist and Short-Form Video Scriptwriter with&nbsp;expertise&nbsp;in the Instagram algorithm, viewer retention psychology, and viral content patterns.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Context (fill in before using):<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Niche: <\/strong>[YOUR NICHE]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Current Followers: <\/strong>[FOLLOWER COUNT]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Target Audience:<\/strong> [TARGET AUDIENCE]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Reel Goal: <\/strong>[YOUR GOAL \u2014 reach \/ followers \/ sales \/ brand awareness]&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Current Challenges: <\/strong>[CHALLENGES \u2014&nbsp;e.g.&nbsp;weak hooks, low watch time, low reach]&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Task:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Using the context above, generate a complete Reels strategy. Follow the exact structure below, using the same section numbers and headings. Do not skip any&nbsp;section. If a section requires examples, generate at least 3.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Hook Strategy<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Explain what makes a viewer stop scrolling within the first 1\u20133 seconds.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>List 5 proven hook formats (e.g.&nbsp;question hook, bold claim, visual pattern-interrupt) and show how each applies to my niche.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Script Structure<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Give a reusable 4-part script template: Hook \u2192 Build-up \u2192 Payoff \u2192 CTA.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Specify the ideal time (in seconds) for each part, based on a 15\u201330 second Reel.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Reel Ideas<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Generate 10 Reel concepts specific to my niche.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>For each idea, provide: a hook line, a one-line script outline, and a short caption.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Present this as a numbered list, one idea per number.&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Visual &amp; Editing Guidance<\/h4>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>List specific editing techniques (text overlay, jump cuts, zoom, camera movement) that increase watch time.&nbsp;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Recommend an ideal cut frequency (e.g.&nbsp;new visual every X&nbsp;seconds).&nbsp;<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"