-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032904696","name":"13. Are AI-generated captions good for engagement?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"They can be, but only when edited. Captions posted directly from an AI tool without any\u00a0personal touch\u00a0tend to sound generic, and generic content typically earns less engagement than posts with a clear individual voice. The best results come from using AI for the structure and first draft, then adding your own stories, opinions, and specific details.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032919019","position":14,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032919019","name":"14. How long should an Instagram prompt be?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Long enough to include the content type, your niche, your target audience, your goal, and your preferred tone, usually two to four sentences. Short, vague prompts like \"write an Instagram caption\" produce generic results. Detailed prompts that specify\u00a0all of\u00a0the above produce drafts much closer to something you can post with minimal edits.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032937742","position":15,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032937742","name":"15. Should I edit AI-generated Instagram content?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, always. Treat AI output as a first draft, not a finished post. Add personal stories, specific numbers or examples, and your own opinions before posting. This is the single biggest factor separating AI-assisted content that performs well from AI-assisted content that feels flat and generic.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032956143","position":16,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/instagram-prompt-ideas\/#faq-question-1784032956143","name":"16. Are Instagram AI prompts free?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Writing and using a prompt costs nothing beyond access to an AI tool. Many tools, including ChatGPT, Claude, and Canva, offer free tiers that are enough for most creators\u00a0posting\u00a0a few times a week. Paid plans\u00a0mainly add\u00a0higher usage limits, brand voice training, or built-in scheduling and analytics.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"}]}},"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/14133","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/15"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=14133"}],"version-history":[{"count":30,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/14133\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":22798,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/14133\/revisions\/22798"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/21573"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=14133"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=14133"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=14133"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated"